Design of the cyclic model:

```lean
import Mathlib.Tactic
import Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic
import Mathlib.Data.ZMod.Basic

namespace Poincare.D7.Bochner

open Finset

variable {ι : Type*} [Fintype ι] [DecidableEq ι] {N : ℕ}

/-- Configuration space. -/
abbrev Conf (ι : Type*) (N : ℕ) := ι → ZMod N

/-- Translation in direction i. -/
def shift (i : ι) (f : Conf ι N → ℝ) : Conf ι N → ℝ :=
  fun x => f (x + Pi.single i 1)

/-- Forward difference in direction i. -/
noncomputable? def diff (i : ι) (f : Conf ι N → ℝ) : Conf ι N → ℝ :=
  fun x => shift i f x - f x
```

Note: `Pi.single i 1 : ι → ZMod N` requires `[DecidableEq ι]` and `Zero ((j : ι) → ZMod N)` (Pi zero instance exists). Good.

Lemmas:
